  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "無人機基本操作",
    "sub_ename": "BASIC APPLICATION OF DRONES FLIGHT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程教導無人機飛行操作，帶領學生實際操作無人機飛行與航拍，也在課程中帶領學生參加無人機證照考照，增加學生未來就業競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This purpose of this course is to teach the flight operations of drones, lead students to actually operate the drones and aerial photography. This course also leads students to participate in the drone license examination to increase students' future employment competitiveness.",
